TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange
SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp false
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -step true
    -totals Alkalinity
END
